flowchart TD
  A[Agent query] --> B[Resolve trusted tenant and actor]
  B --> C[Resolve permitted knowledge scopes]
  C --> D[Vector and keyword retrieval]
  D --> E[ACL and metadata filter]
  E --> F[Rerank]
  F --> G[Evidence threshold]
  G --> H{Sufficient?}
  H -->|Yes| I[Generate grounded output with citations]
  H -->|No| J[Abstain / ask human]
  I --> K[Validate citations and schema]
  K --> L[Persist output and evidence refs]
